sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Volunteer
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant DB as Supabase (Postgres + RLS)

    V->>FE: Select shift and click Sign Up
    FE->>DB: Query shift capacity and current signups
    DB-->>FE: Capacity data

    alt Shift at capacity
        FE-->>V: Show Shift full error
    else Capacity available
        FE->>DB: Query volunteer's existing signups
        DB-->>FE: Existing signups

        alt Overlapping shift found
            FE-->>V: Show Schedule conflict error
        else No overlap
            FE->>DB: Insert signup with status confirmed
            DB-->>FE: Signup confirmed
            FE-->>V: Show confirmation
        end
    end
